; Lili, the full theme from sketch B "Carousel": F# minor, 6/8, 104 bpm, a 2-bar intro and a 32-bar loop (about 56 s). A koto rocks a music-box hook with a chromatic F natural against the minor chord (A), takes it through B minor and C#7 (B); a clarinet sings a contrasting tune in A major over koto arpeggios (C); the hook returns with everything: the koto doubled an octave down, a busier clarinet and a fuller kit (A2).
; Koto A.117, clarinet A.71, pick bass A.36, strings A.48, kit A.120. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song lili
tempo 104
meter 6/8
reverb 173
priority 0

